  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1604.01 Certification Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1604.01 Certification Required.\n\n(a) All individuals identified in Env-Sw 1602.01 who are not covered by an exemption in Env-Sw 1602.02 shall:\n\n(1) Be certified by the department pursuant to this chapter; or\n\n(2) Obtain processed applicant status in accordance with Env-Sw 1606.01.\n\n(b) Any individual required to obtain initial certification shall complete and submit a \"Solid Waste Facility Operator Certification Initial Application\", NHDES-S-05-028, April 2023, available at: https://onlineforms.nh.gov/?formtag=nhdes-s-05-028, for certification no more than 30 days after commencing work at the solid waste facility, whether as a paid employee or a volunteer.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1600); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3304.01); ss by #10600, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13623, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1600.html"
